Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Cache structural notice tails between SQLite commits

Apply clock grace and lookback each pass, bypass pinned transactions and retain reader-local commit invalidation. Proof: parent RED unchanged scans; 33 focused tests; nine cache/clock mutants killed; immutable captured-state output parity. Full held-pass cadence proof recorded separately.
